        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/sgf-old-header.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>One of the enduring questions over the past few months - or really years - has been what happens next. Video games have seen arguably their greatest upheaval as a medium, as an exodus of investor cash and evisceration of talent, particularly in North America and Europe, led to a grim drought of the bigger-budget blockbusters that would have normally kept the industry ticking over last year and beyond.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/summer-game-fest-2026-video-games-retreat-past-opinion\">Read more</a></p>",
