        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/delete-AdobeStock_274406420.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Hello and welcome back to our regular feature where we write a little about the games we've been playing. This week, Bertie and Connor break the rules slightly, but it's okay because Bertie organises What We've Been Playing and Connor regularly contributes to it, so they both get a pass. Elsewhere, believes again that another game has been tailormade for them - I'm beginning to sense a pattern - and Hitman fan Kelsey rolls credits on Bond and gets a bit emotional.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/what-weve-been-playing-deleted-steam\">Read more</a></p>",
